  "title": "H 3594 (South Carolina Constitutional Carry/Second Amendment Preservation Act of 2023), Act No. 111 (R121) (125th Session, 2023-2024) — Constitutional carry: handgun carry is unlawful only in listed places; plus penalties, permit changes, expungement and training",
  "urls": [
